Qwen3.8-27B-2: load an EXL3 drafter (igor255/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2-EXL3-4.00bpw). Stock DFlash2 reads a bf16 drafter
only. This decodes each EXL3 group (trellis/suh/svh/mul1) on the GPU to bf16 W = diag(suh) H W_q H diag(svh) and then
packs it to affine 4-bit as for a bf16 drafter; admission counts the same bytes. Only draft acceptance is affected,
never target output. Applies after 0004.

